  "prefLabel": "Abfd 213.02 Cease and Desist Orders",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-10-17",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Abfd 213.02 Cease and Desist Orders. If the committee's final decision after hearing is that there is a conflict between the code for barrier-free design and the proposed, ongoing or existing building's or facility's construction, rehabilitation or substantial remodeling, the committee shall, pursuant to RSA 275-C:15, III, issue a cease-and-desist order enjoining the building's or facility's owner, owner's agent or lessee-in-possession from further construction or use of the building or facility.\n\nSource. #7770, eff 10-2-02, EXPIRED: 10-2-10\n\nNew. #10118, INTERIM, eff 4-20-12, EXPIRES: 10-17-12\n\nNew. #10284-A, eff 3-5-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/abfd100-300.html"
